<title>NAURU: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>NAURU GOVERNMENT LIST (961112)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 12 Nov 96 - Republic of Nauru announced that Bernard	*</p>
<p> *		 Dowiyogo had been elected as the new president*</p>
<p> *		 after a vote of no confidence in the previous *</p>
<p> *		 government. A new cabinet is to be formed.    *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> President (Elected 11 Nov 96)................Bernard DOWIYOGO</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>OUTGOING MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Civil Aviation..................................See President</p>
<p> Education.......................................Kennan ADEANG</p>
<p> External Affairs................................See President</p>
<p> Finance &amp; Minister Assisting the President.........Reuben KUN</p>
<p> Health.......................................Clinton BENJAMIN</p>
<p> Island Development &amp; Industry...................See President</p>
<p> Justice.........................................Anthony AUDOA</p>
<p> Public Service..................................See President</p>
<p> Works, Community Services......................Roy DEGOREGORE</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Parliament Speaker...............................Derog GIOURA</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			   (End Government List)</p>
